{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nubs</strong> are tiny, unpredictable warriors locked in a relentless arena battle striving to be the last one standing. Online or in local couch co-op, 4 to 20 players can engage in fast-paced top-down PvP combat where quick reflexes and roguelite buffs determine the victor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Customize-your-Nub_v2.gif?t=1744116561\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand out in the mayhem with a vast selection of outlandish outfits and eye-searing colors. With so many combinations, you\u2019ll either look fearsome, funny, on-trend or completely ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Scavange-Loot-and-Fight.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic weapons, then scavenge the battlefield for upgrades. Crack open chests for better firepower, or claim weapons from defeated foes, after all, they won\u2019t be needing them anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through dynamic arenas filled with deadly hazards. Spikes, lava, and other dangers ensure that your opponents are not the only thing you should be afraid of... <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Survive-and-Revive.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even death isn\u2019t the end. Once eliminated, you become a floating star containing all your hopes, dreams, and regrets. Survive long enough in this form, and you\u2019ll get another shot at victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Five-Rounds.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match consists of five frantic rounds. After each round, select a passive ability that either boosts your chances of survival or amplifies the absurdity of battle. Choose strategically, or pick the one with the silliest name, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIFs---Title---Konzumos.gif?t=1744116561\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win, lose, or perish in spectacular fashion. Konzumos is only interested in a good show.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extensive Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Craft a Nub that stands out in the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Battle solo or in teams with up to 20 people.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced, Action-Packed Battles with Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 One more match quickly turns into ten.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A</strong> <strong>Variety of Weapons &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Some are powerful, some are absurd, and some are just\u2026 fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s NOT Included:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Friends to Play With</strong> \u2013 Bring your own, try and find some through matchmaking, or embrace the void.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for absolute mayhem\u2014because only one Nub can claim the crown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2337860?t=1744116561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/aa8349acc556a1ed1ec34f3066d1caee48998332/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744116561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/93344f600cc1b2c37997efd647036709b713a2d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744116561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/93344f600cc1b2c37997efd647036709b713a2d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744116561","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Free to keep for the first 24h</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/Free_to_Claim_for_the_first_24h!__2_.png?t=1744116561\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nubs</strong> are tiny, unpredictable warriors locked in a relentless arena battle striving to be the last one standing. Online or in local couch co-op, 4 to 20 players can engage in fast-paced top-down PvP combat where quick reflexes and roguelite buffs determine the victor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Customize-your-Nub_v2.gif?t=1744116561\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand out in the mayhem with a vast selection of outlandish outfits and eye-searing colors. With so many combinations, you\u2019ll either look fearsome, funny, on-trend or completely ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Scavange-Loot-and-Fight.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic weapons, then scavenge the battlefield for upgrades. Crack open chests for better firepower, or claim weapons from defeated foes, after all, they won\u2019t be needing them anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through dynamic arenas filled with deadly hazards. Spikes, lava, and other dangers ensure that your opponents are not the only thing you should be afraid of... <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Survive-and-Revive.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even death isn\u2019t the end. Once eliminated, you become a floating star containing all your hopes, dreams, and regrets. Survive long enough in this form, and you\u2019ll get another shot at victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIF_Five-Rounds.gif?t=1744116561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match consists of five frantic rounds. After each round, select a passive ability that either boosts your chances of survival or amplifies the absurdity of battle. Choose strategically, or pick the one with the silliest name, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/extras/GIFs---Title---Konzumos.gif?t=1744116561\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win, lose, or perish in spectacular fashion. Konzumos is only interested in a good show.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extensive Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Craft a Nub that stands out in the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Battle solo or in teams with up to 20 people.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced, Action-Packed Battles with Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 One more match quickly turns into ten.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A</strong> <strong>Variety of Weapons &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Some are powerful, some are absurd, and some are just\u2026 fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s NOT Included:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Friends to Play With</strong> \u2013 Bring your own, try and find some through matchmaking, or embrace the void.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for absolute mayhem\u2014because only one Nub can claim the crown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Rangatang","Glowfish Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/bf18a1e2d6308f42a501efdaaa266ae6f6bd1273/header.jpg?t=1744116561","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Rangatang & Glowfish Interactive","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123539,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123539/movie480.mp4?t=1744116558","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123539/movie_max.mp4?t=1744116558"},"name":"Nubs! - Release Date Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123539/147540d092e45847a0cb8b86e4928783d8c87274/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744116558","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123539/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744116558","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123539/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744116558"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257075138,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075138/movie480.mp4?t=1742482403","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075138/movie_max.mp4?t=1742482403"},