soon":true,"date":"15 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cNubs aims to deliver fast-paced, arena-based battles for up to four players, fighting in chaotic brawls using quirk-based characters, daft weapons, and lethal traps\u2013and it looks pretty damn great.\u201d<br>Forbes<br><br>\u201cNubs! is a multiplayer brawler. Not like Smash Bros, mind you. Looking at it, it reminds me of The Legend of Zelda: Four Swords.\u201d<br>Destructoid<br><br>\u201cAwesomenauts devs reclaim their unfinished game as new studio Rangatang\u201d<br>GamesIndustry<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_5a8932af8320a970a725aeffc57e6f6c1d0b1231.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744116561","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_5a8932af8320a970a725aeffc57e6f6c1d0b1231.600x338.jpg?t=1744116561"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_829f8d7cf69584d4565365b46828192b4ac41b42.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744116561","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_829f8d7cf69584d4565365b46828192b4ac41b42.600x338.jpg?t=1744116561"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_56a73d31eff9646196815a76e04b53b0cab4d180.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744116561","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_56a73d31eff9646196815a76e04b53b0cab4d180.600x338.jpg?t=1744116561"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_28d26fc7906591bb6984a07c14baf8f48566a7ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744116561","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/ss_28d26fc7906591bb6984a07c14baf8f48566a7ca.600x338.jpg?t=1744116561"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860